       y="190"
       font-size="14"
       font-weight="500"
       text-anchor="middle"
       fill="#1F4E79"
       id="text22">
      Ponding zone (stage–storage, β = 2)
    </text>
    <!-- overflow weir crest indicator at +0.2 m (y=180): just a dashed line,
